A 24 MHz timebase for the guest's userspace over the host's architected counter (droidvm-timebase-hz): every kernel read of
the counter scaled by target/hardware, decrementer values converted back, the target frequency reported, and userspace given
the timebase through the mach_absolute_time trap. libswift_Concurrency converts Task.sleep deadlines with Apple's 125/3.

